# Claude
# Skills, commands and agents under .claude/ are the single copy that both Claude
# Code and GitHub Copilot read, so they are tracked. Local state (settings.local.json,
# worktrees, plans) stays out. APM and ProductShape regenerate their managed files.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/hooks/
.claude/hooks/*
!.claude/hooks/product-definition.json

# Agent folders some IDE tools (Codex and others) generate from .claude/ on
# workspace open; this repository keeps the single copy under .claude/.
.agents/
.codex/

# Product Definition as Code: regenerable outputs, never canonical.
.product/generated/
.product/cache/
